                <airSeal>High air leackage from the windows</airSeal>
                <mainWalls>Walls are cold in winter. Addition of insulation recommended. Min R-20 for rebate</mainWalls>
                <ceilings>Roof insulation R-40. If upgrades planned optimal R value is R-70

However because of the roof design, major works might be necessary to create enough space for an additional insulation to reach R-70.</ceilings>
                <ceilingsCathedral>N/A</ceilingsCathedral>
                <exposedFloors>Air infiltration from the exposed floor. This section is cold in winter. The upgrade of the insulation underneath the bay window (the exposed part of the floor) will help to reduce air draft and heat loss from the floor.</exposedFloors>
                <foundation>Foundation walls insulation upgrade recommended. A minimum of R-20 is required to be eligible to the rebate.</foundation>
                <windows>The windows are very leacky, replacement of sealing recommended</windows>
                <doors>Back door very leacky and cold. Replacement is recommended.</doors>
                <VentilationSystem>Recommended to ameliorate the air circulation</VentilationSystem>
                <CoolingSystem>N/A</CoolingSystem>
                <Renewables>N/A</Renewables>
                <WaterConservation>N/A</WaterConservation>
                <AdditionalComments>If renovation from outside, ensure the continuity of the air barrier to make the space air tight</AdditionalComments>
